OL,4,CTour highlights city's modernist       
OL,5,Clandmarks                              
OL,6,GHull's modernist, post-war landmarks   
OL,7,Gare being brought to life in a new     
OL,8,Ginteractive tour.                      
OL,10,FThe city now appears on The Modernist  
OL,11,Fapp, an architectural guide produced   
OL,12,Fby the Modernist Society, which        
OL,13,Fcelebrates 20th Century design.        
OL,15,FAlong the route, which is nearly 2.5   
OL,16,Fmiles long, walkers encounter some of  
OL,17,FHull's best-known mid-century          
OL,18,Flandmarks, including the Cecil Cinema, 
OL,19,Fthe former Hammonds Department Store   
OL,20,Fand the Three Ships mural.             
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
