OL,4,CArtist moved by response to mural to   
OL,5,C'best friend'                          
OL,6,GA graffiti artist has said he has been 
OL,7,G"overwhelmed" by the public response   
OL,8,Gto a mural he painted in tribute to    
OL,9,Ghis best friend.                       
OL,11,FAndrew 'Rew' Nurse, 42, who was a well-
OL,12,Fknown street artist and mural painter  
OL,13,Fin Scarborough, died suddenly last     
OL,14,Fmonth.                                 
OL,16,FBut a lasting tribute to his memory    
OL,17,Fhas sprung up on a wall close to a     
OL,18,Fbridge next to the town's Sainsbury's  
OL,19,Fcar park, courtesy of fellow creative  
OL,20,FBen Walgate.                           
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
